<title>USA: Morgan Stanley $300 mln debt issue expected.</title>
<headline>Morgan Stanley $300 mln debt issue expected.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley Group is expected to tap the corporate bond market with a $300 million debt offering on its own behalf, dealers said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The A1/A-plus rated deal is expected to include a five-year maturity, dealers said.</p>
<p>The issuing entity is Morgan Stanley Group and the underwriter is Morgan Stanley Dean Witter.</p>
<p>No further details were available on the offering.</p>
<p>(( -- Nancy Leinfuss, 212-859-1675 ))</p>
</text>
